From: A23 bring-up <a23@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] sepolicy: give stock vendor policy a single tested owner

The SEZB1 policy targets API 30 while cnb builds current platform policy.
Select the audited stock vendor CIL and raw contexts through the standard
module names; preserve source compilers, context tests and neverallow checks.
Recompile the combined policy for this platform and regenerate its hashes.
Do not install the obsolete stock ODM precompiled binary or duplicate copies.

Applies after 0001-restore-api30-compatibility.patch to
Evolution-X/system_sepolicy at c3997bf608b40a7217d0eb2257af887afa78617b.
Enabled only by a23.use_stock_vendor_policy; default products retain source
policy inputs. Vendor filegroups are supplied by vendor/samsung/a235f.

